{"id":"certeza","lemma":"certeza","pos":"noun","rank":141,"glosses":["certainty (state of being certain)","something which is certain"],"ipa":"/sɨɾˈte.zɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a2/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-certeza.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-certeza.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"certezas"},"examples":[{"text":"Ainda não tenho certeza.","en":"I'm still not certain.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/534953","words":[{"g":"still"},{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"have","l":"ter"},null]},{"text":"Tem certeza que quer saber?","en":"Are you sure that you want to know?","words":[{"g":"has / there is","l":"ter"},null,{"g":"that / what"},null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"you know what"]]},{"text":"Quero ter certeza.","en":"I want to be sure.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/471592","words":[{"g":"to want","l":"querer"},{"g":"to own"},null]},{"text":"Quem sabe de certeza?","en":"Who knows for sure?","words":[null,null,{"g":"of / from"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"maybe"]]},{"text":"Ele virá com certeza.","en":"He'll come for sure.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/852139","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to come","l":"vir"},{"g":"with"},null]}]}